menu "Weather Station"

    config WEATHER_SAMPLE_PERIOD_MS
        int "Sensor sample period (ms)"
        default 5000
        range 1000 60000
        help
            How often sensor_task reads the BME280, in milliseconds (FR-1).
            The project default is 5000 (every 5 s). The range is a guard
            rail chosen for this project, not a value from the overview.

    config WEATHER_PUBLISH_PERIOD_MS
        int "MQTT publish period (ms)"
        default 30000
        range WEATHER_SAMPLE_PERIOD_MS 600000
        help
            How often a reading is published to the MQTT broker, in
            milliseconds (FR-6). The project default is 30000 (every 30 s).
            It cannot be shorter than the sample period, so there is always
            a new reading to publish. The range is a guard rail chosen for this
            project, not a value from the overview.

    config WEATHER_DEVICE_ID
        string "Device ID"
        default "esp32-weather-01"
        help
            Identifier included in every published JSON reading (FR-6).
            The default is a placeholder, not a real identifier. Set your own
            here or in the git-ignored sdkconfig. Do not put a real ID in
            sdkconfig.defaults.

    config WEATHER_BME280_I2C_ADDR
        hex "BME280 I2C address"
        default 0x76
        range 0x76 0x77
        help
            I2C address of the BME280 (HW-2). Use 0x76 when SDO is tied to
            GND and 0x77 when SDO is tied to VDD. The sensor driver reads
            this value (wired up in s2-t7-bme280-address-config).

endmenu
